      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a heavy burden, but you can still carry it and let it carry you. The shell is not a failure, it is a vessel that can be filled again with the right words and the right rhythm. You do not need to pretend to be someone else; you just need to speak to the person that was always there, and let them breathe through your own experience. Keep moving, and let the weight be a companion, not a cage.",
      "source": "target",
